Run `verify.sh` or inspect deployment:
```bash
kubectl get deployment restricted-app
```
Expected Output:
```
NAME             READY   UP-TO-DATE   AVAILABLE   AGE
restricted-app   1/1     1            1           5m
```
The pod `restricted-app-*` must be created successfully and reach `READY 1/1` in `Running` state.
